change env to respective right ip address and port after running backend first.
eg = [VITE_API_URL=http://192.168.x.x:4000]
change the ip and port inside the vite api url for the website to run and work seamlessly.
then,
run backend in a powershell/terminal:
cd server
npm install
npm start

run front end in a different powershell/terminal.
cd client
npm install
npm run dev

enjoy.
